        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Thanksgiving release cleanout]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Twice a year, around Thanksgiving and Spring, Corion takes stock of all the code that has amassed on his systems. He tries to release it on CPAN, or publish it on GitHub, if not as a way of giving back to the community then at least as another off-site backup. This time: String::FuzzyMatch, AppTemplate-Perl-Mojolicious, Linux-ARPTable, App-CaptureAgenda, Protocol::Samsung::MDC.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.11.15</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://corion.net/blog/2026/11/15/thanksgiving-release-cleanout/</guid>
            <link>https://corion.net/blog/2026/11/15/thanksgiving-release-cleanout/</link>
            
            
            
